        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami Uhoraho ampaye ururimi rw’abigishwa, kugira ngo mmenye uko nosindagirisha ūrushe amajambo; ankangura uko bukeye, akangurira ugutwi kwanje kwumva, nk’ukw abigishwa bumviriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
