              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abankubita nabategeye ibitugu, n’imisaya ndayitegera abammomora ubganwa; kandi mu maso hanje sinahakinjishije gutēterezwa no gucirwakw amate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
